==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|kyssa|lang=non}} ("to kiss").

===Verb===
'''kyssa''' (+ {{accusative}}) (''weak conjugation:'' [[kyssti]] – [[kysst]])

# to [[kiss]]
#: '''''Kysstu''' mig!''
#:: '''Kiss''' me!
#: ''Viltu '''kyssa''' mig?''
#:: Do you want to '''kiss''' me?
#: ''Hefurðu [[einhvern tíma]] '''kysst''' einhvern?''
#:: Have you ever '''kissed''' someone?

====Derived terms====
* [[kyssast]]
* [[kyssa á hönd]]
* [[kyssilegur]] {{m}}, [[kyssileg]] {{f}}, [[kyssilegt]] {{n}}

